It seems there was a misunderstanding in the previous response. As an advertiser, you should call the function to announce your bid. Here's the correct function call for you to submit your bid for this round:

```json
{
  "type": "function",
  "function": {
    "name": "announce_bid",
    "arguments": {
      "bid": 14.43
    }
  }
}
```
